Tuya Convert doesn't seem to work. The device is ultrasonically welded. I have managed to flash it by disassembling the device, desoldering the PCB, and soldering wires to the pins on the [TYWE2S module](https://developer.tuya.com/docs/iot/tywe2s?id=K9hhi0xr3f3ub). You might also have success with the test points on the back of the module, but that isn't exactly easy given the cramped PCB layout.
